### POST request for register a new user
POST http://localhost:8000/api/user/register
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "username": "novemsis",
    "password": "test1234",
    "first_name": "Ben",
    "last_name": "Damerow"
}

### POST request logging in an existing user
POST http://localhost:8000/api/user/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "username": "novemsis",
    "password": "test1234"
}

### POST request for logging out a logged in user
GET http://localhost:8000/api/user/logout
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
